-- The constrained reference's capacities where the AN505 has memory: its
-- Cortex-M33 boots in Secure state with VTOR at 0x1000_0000, the Secure
-- alias of the 4 MiB SSRAM1, so the 32 KiB of flash and the vector table
-- start there, and the 16 KiB of RAM, the upper 4 KiB the stack, is at
-- 0x3800_0000, the Secure alias of the 4 MiB SSRAM2 (D607).  The sizes are
-- the reference's, so a program fits here exactly when it fits there.

linker.region("FLASH", 0x1000_0000, 32 * 1024, "rx")
linker.region("RAM", 0x3800_0000, 16 * 1024, "rwx")
compiler.boot("vector-table")
linker.place("vectors", "FLASH")
linker.place("text", "FLASH")
linker.place("rodata", "FLASH")
linker.place("data", "RAM")
linker.place("bss", "RAM")
linker.place("stack", "RAM", 4 * 1024)
